        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sent to a remote space facility for inspection. You've been left for dead as you find that the facility has been abandoned by all human life. With the air not fit for breathing if not for your oxygen tank, you must find your way out of the facility before you Asphyxiate, all the while, shaking the feeling that you're being watched.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get lost in a procedurally generated facility looking for the exit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for air canisters to avoid asphyxiating</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go crazy as you witness things not as they are meant to be</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you see it, pretend you don't, but do not approach</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now featuring revolutionary ball technology!  </p></li></ul>",
